    <description>Compares the email the resident typed with the email on the Contact. Only when they match, emails a one-time door code to the address on the record from the org-wide address and returns the contact id, type, a signed authentication key, email_matched, rate_limited and email_sent. At most 3 codes are sent per contact per hour. The code is never returned. When the email was sent it reuses the resident&apos;s open Door Access Case (Status New, same contact and apartment) or creates one with Status New, and returns door_case_id.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
